WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.533
Congressman Jim

00:00:00.533 --> 00:00:01.501
Jordan's crusade

00:00:01.501 --> 00:00:03.436
against the DOJ and FBI showing

00:00:03.436 --> 00:00:04.904
signs of falling apart.

00:00:04.904 --> 00:00:05.672
Jordan has long

00:00:05.672 --> 00:00:07.107
promised a major investigation

00:00:07.107 --> 00:00:07.941
into the agency's

00:00:07.941 --> 00:00:09.676
political bias as he sees it.

00:00:09.676 --> 00:00:10.243
But tonight,

00:00:10.243 --> 00:00:11.578
there are growing questions

00:00:11.578 --> 00:00:12.379
about the witnesses

00:00:12.379 --> 00:00:14.080
who are central to his case.

00:00:14.080 --> 00:00:14.981
This is Republicans

00:00:14.981 --> 00:00:16.082
like Matt Gates are using

00:00:16.082 --> 00:00:17.884
the topic as red meat for the base.

00:00:17.884 --> 00:00:20.120
Here he is just today

00:00:21.021 --> 00:00:21.921
We have been taking

00:00:21.921 --> 00:00:23.523
whistleblower testimony

00:00:23.523 --> 00:00:25.492
from brave patriots,

00:00:25.492 --> 00:00:27.827
people who worked at the FBI.

00:00:28.061 --> 00:00:29.229
And I don't care

00:00:29.229 --> 00:00:31.998
if it takes every second of our time

00:00:32.132 --> 00:00:34.034
and every ounce of our energy,

00:00:34.034 --> 00:00:35.402
we either get this government

00:00:35.402 --> 00:00:36.603
back on our side

00:00:36.603 --> 00:00:39.973
or we defund and get rid of abolish

00:00:40.140 --> 00:00:43.610
the FBI, CDC, ATF,

00:00:44.611 --> 00:00:46.880
DOJ, every last one of us.

00:00:48.715 --> 00:00:50.050
Sara Murray is OUTFRONT

00:00:52.619 --> 00:00:53.953
House Judiciary Chair Jim

00:00:53.953 --> 00:00:55.321
Jordan pinning his probe

00:00:55.321 --> 00:00:56.756
into alleged political bias

00:00:56.756 --> 00:00:57.824
at the Justice Department

00:00:57.824 --> 00:01:00.360
and the FBI on unnamed whistleblowers.

00:01:00.460 --> 00:01:03.063
This is dozens of FBI whistleblowers

00:01:03.329 --> 00:01:04.597
coming to talk to us.

00:01:04.597 --> 00:01:05.432
We expect

00:01:05.432 --> 00:01:07.133
more whistleblowers to come forward

00:01:07.133 --> 00:01:09.102
and set for these depositions.

00:01:09.102 --> 00:01:10.203
But after three of them sat

00:01:10.203 --> 00:01:11.171
for private interviews,

00:01:11.171 --> 00:01:11.971
with committee staff,

00:01:11.971 --> 00:01:13.273
Democrats are questioning

00:01:13.273 --> 00:01:14.007
their legitimacy

00:01:14.007 --> 00:01:15.375
as actual whistleblowers

00:01:15.375 --> 00:01:17.544
and the relevance of their testimony.

00:01:17.544 --> 00:01:19.012
You just said dozens are

00:01:19.012 --> 00:01:20.380
you do have notes from those

00:01:20.380 --> 00:01:22.082
or they're just talking to you, to

00:01:22.082 --> 00:01:23.016
your chair.

00:01:23.016 --> 00:01:23.950
None of the three appear

00:01:23.950 --> 00:01:24.784
to have had their claims

00:01:24.784 --> 00:01:26.319
validated by government entities

00:01:26.319 --> 00:01:27.153
that grant federal

00:01:27.153 --> 00:01:28.721
whistleblower protection, sources

00:01:28.721 --> 00:01:29.622
tell CNN.

00:01:29.622 --> 00:01:30.490
One of the GOP

00:01:30.490 --> 00:01:31.591
whistleblowers is former

00:01:31.591 --> 00:01:33.493
FBI agent Steve Friend.

00:01:33.493 --> 00:01:35.161
I don't think you have to be

00:01:35.161 --> 00:01:37.964
a nonpartisan if you are a partizan to

00:01:38.164 --> 00:01:39.099
to come to the conclusion

00:01:39.099 --> 00:01:41.234
that the FBI has clearly prioritized

00:01:41.234 --> 00:01:43.169
this January six investigation

00:01:43.169 --> 00:01:45.305
and is willing to put the public safety

00:01:45.338 --> 00:01:46.039
at risk.

00:01:47.140 --> 00:01:47.774
He says he was

00:01:47.774 --> 00:01:49.476
suspended for objecting to a SWAT

00:01:49.476 --> 00:01:50.777
raid of a January six

00:01:50.777 --> 00:01:52.112
suspect facing arrest

00:01:52.112 --> 00:01:53.947
for misdemeanor offenses.

00:01:53.947 --> 00:01:55.682
But the suspect was seen at the Capitol

00:01:55.682 --> 00:01:56.282
on January

00:01:56.282 --> 00:01:58.017
six with an air style rifle

00:01:58.017 --> 00:01:59.552
and tactical military gear.

00:01:59.552 --> 00:02:01.087
According to court records,

00:02:01.087 --> 00:02:02.755
Still, Friend told CNN, quote,

00:02:02.755 --> 00:02:04.657
I compared it to using an elephant gun

00:02:04.657 --> 00:02:06.092
to kill a mouse.

00:02:06.092 --> 00:02:07.527
He filed whistleblower complaint

00:02:07.527 --> 00:02:09.129
with the DOJ's inspector general

00:02:09.129 --> 00:02:11.064
and the U.S. Office of Special Counsel.

00:02:11.064 --> 00:02:11.865
Both officers

00:02:11.865 --> 00:02:14.067
eventually rejected his claims.

00:02:14.067 --> 00:02:15.301
Another whistleblower, Jordan,

00:02:15.301 --> 00:02:16.536
is leaning on for his probe.

00:02:16.536 --> 00:02:18.838
Former FBI analyst George Hill,

00:02:19.072 --> 00:02:21.241
who has tweeted insurrection my ass.

00:02:21.241 --> 00:02:22.375
It was a setup

00:02:22.375 --> 00:02:24.210
about the attack on the Capitol.

00:02:24.210 --> 00:02:26.446
He claimed the FBI tried to open cases

00:02:26.446 --> 00:02:26.946
into people

00:02:26.946 --> 00:02:28.715
merely for traveling to the Capitol

00:02:28.715 --> 00:02:30.183
on January six.

00:02:30.183 --> 00:02:31.050
We're not opening up

00:02:31.050 --> 00:02:32.952
cases for people that were going down

00:02:32.952 --> 00:02:34.621
to a political rally.

00:02:34.621 --> 00:02:36.089
House Judiciary Democrats

00:02:36.089 --> 00:02:38.091
concluded Hill's testimony is marred

00:02:38.091 --> 00:02:38.892
by substantial

00:02:38.892 --> 00:02:39.893
bias and lacks

00:02:39.893 --> 00:02:41.961
any real hallmarks of credibility.

00:02:41.961 --> 00:02:43.863
And an FBI spokesperson said

00:02:43.863 --> 00:02:46.232
the FBI will never open an investigation

00:02:46.232 --> 00:02:47.400
based solely on First

00:02:47.400 --> 00:02:49.169
Amendment protected activity.

00:02:49.169 --> 00:02:50.103
A nonprofit group

00:02:50.103 --> 00:02:52.071
representing Hill told CNN to wait

00:02:52.071 --> 00:02:53.806
for the official transcript, quote,

00:02:53.806 --> 00:02:55.441
before reporting on selective

00:02:55.441 --> 00:02:56.943
partizan leaks.

00:02:56.943 --> 00:02:57.810
A third GOP

00:02:57.810 --> 00:02:58.778
whistleblower, Garett

00:02:58.778 --> 00:03:00.413
O'Boyle, says he was suspended

00:03:00.413 --> 00:03:01.214
from the FBI

00:03:01.214 --> 00:03:02.715
and stripped of his security clearance

00:03:02.715 --> 00:03:04.751
after allegedly making an unauthorized

00:03:04.751 --> 00:03:07.220
media disclosure a claim he denies.

00:03:07.387 --> 00:03:07.987
He described

00:03:07.987 --> 00:03:09.422
this as being a weaponization

00:03:09.422 --> 00:03:11.024
of the security clearance process,

00:03:11.024 --> 00:03:13.193
according to the Democratic staff report.

00:03:13.193 --> 00:03:14.060
But on many points,

00:03:14.060 --> 00:03:15.728
he refused to elaborate or offer

00:03:15.728 --> 00:03:17.931
Democrats corroborating evidence.

00:03:17.931 --> 00:03:18.598
His attorney,

00:03:18.598 --> 00:03:19.832
a former election attorney

00:03:19.832 --> 00:03:20.300
for Donald

00:03:20.300 --> 00:03:20.900
Trump,

00:03:20.900 --> 00:03:21.668
told CNN

00:03:21.668 --> 00:03:22.535
his client provided

00:03:22.535 --> 00:03:24.370
confidential information to Congress,

00:03:24.370 --> 00:03:25.838
but he did not release

00:03:25.838 --> 00:03:26.573
that information

00:03:26.573 --> 00:03:27.807
to Democrats on the committee

00:03:27.807 --> 00:03:29.242
because he knew that they would leaked

00:03:29.242 --> 00:03:30.577
to the media

00:03:30.577 --> 00:03:31.844
Delegate Stacey Plaskett,

00:03:31.844 --> 00:03:32.745
the top Democrat

00:03:32.745 --> 00:03:34.047
on the so-called weaponization

00:03:34.047 --> 00:03:35.515
committee, tells CNN.

00:03:35.515 --> 00:03:36.950
I said at the outset that I thought

00:03:36.950 --> 00:03:38.184
that this was a mechanism

00:03:38.184 --> 00:03:38.851
for them to float

00:03:38.851 --> 00:03:40.119
every conspiracy theory

00:03:40.119 --> 00:03:41.721
that they might want to try and utilize

00:03:41.721 --> 00:03:43.423
in the 20, 24 election.

00:03:43.423 --> 00:03:44.524
And it appears like that's,

00:03:44.524 --> 00:03:46.359
in fact, the case.

00:03:46.359 --> 00:03:48.061
A spokesperson for Jordan in a statement

00:03:48.061 --> 00:03:49.362
accused Democrats of leaking

00:03:49.362 --> 00:03:51.197
Cherry picked excerpts of testimony

00:03:51.197 --> 00:03:52.765
to attack the brave whistleblowers

00:03:52.765 --> 00:03:54.133
who risked their careers

00:03:54.133 --> 00:03:55.268
to speak out on abuses

00:03:55.268 --> 00:03:57.270
at the Justice Department and FBI.

00:03:58.938 --> 00:03:59.706
Now, an FBI

00:03:59.706 --> 00:04:01.874
spokesperson tells CNN when FBI employees

00:04:01.874 --> 00:04:03.576
report actual evidence of wrongdoing,

00:04:03.576 --> 00:04:05.511
they are protected from retaliation.

00:04:05.511 --> 00:04:06.312
We are also learning

00:04:06.312 --> 00:04:07.313
there are several other

00:04:07.313 --> 00:04:08.581
supposed whistleblowers

00:04:08.581 --> 00:04:09.482
who have yet to come in

00:04:09.482 --> 00:04:10.650
with interviews with the committee,

00:04:10.650 --> 00:04:11.251
including some

00:04:11.251 --> 00:04:13.019
who were suspended from the FBI

00:04:13.019 --> 00:04:14.220
for attending demonstrations

00:04:14.220 --> 00:04:16.055
at the Capitol on January six, sources

00:04:16.055 --> 00:04:16.889
tell CNN.

00:04:16.889 --> 00:04:18.224
And Jordan has not back down

00:04:18.224 --> 00:04:19.092
from that point, Aaron.

00:04:19.092 --> 00:04:19.692
He's previously

00:04:19.692 --> 00:04:20.593
accused the FBI

00:04:20.593 --> 00:04:22.195
of retaliating against employees

00:04:22.195 --> 00:04:22.962
for taking part

00:04:22.962 --> 00:04:24.931
in First Amendment activity.

00:04:24.931 --> 00:04:26.232
All right, sir, thank you very much.

00:04:26.232 --> 00:04:27.900
And I want to go now to Ryan Goodman.

00:04:27.900 --> 00:04:28.201
So, Ryan,

00:04:28.201 --> 00:04:30.570
you hear Sarah's reporting going through.

00:04:30.570 --> 00:04:32.972
You know, the three people

00:04:32.972 --> 00:04:33.873
who have testified

00:04:33.873 --> 00:04:34.540
obviously can't use

00:04:34.540 --> 00:04:36.743
the word whistleblowers.

00:04:36.743 --> 00:04:39.212
Jordan says there's there's dozens more

00:04:39.545 --> 00:04:40.413
I guess what

00:04:40.413 --> 00:04:41.648
I am wondering here

00:04:41.648 --> 00:04:42.682
is that

00:04:42.682 --> 00:04:44.951
Jim Jordan really loves this topic.

00:04:44.951 --> 00:04:46.219
So if Jim Jordan had the good,

00:04:46.219 --> 00:04:46.819
he would be wanting

00:04:46.819 --> 00:04:47.954
to make this public, right?

00:04:47.954 --> 00:04:50.023
He wouldn't be like, why are you leaking?

00:04:50.023 --> 00:04:51.758
Be public. It be televised.

00:04:51.758 --> 00:04:53.092
And what does this all say?

00:04:53.092 --> 00:04:54.193
The way it's being handled

00:04:54.193 --> 00:04:56.896
about what he's really got?

00:04:56.896 --> 00:04:57.997
Right. That's a great question.

00:04:57.997 --> 00:04:58.831
If these people have

00:04:58.831 --> 00:05:00.266
the goods, let's hear it.

00:05:00.266 --> 00:05:00.933
And in fact,

00:05:00.933 --> 00:05:02.702
in the over 300 page

00:05:02.702 --> 00:05:04.637
Democratic staff report,

00:05:04.637 --> 00:05:05.538
they actually have a forward

00:05:05.538 --> 00:05:07.173
by the ranking members

00:05:07.173 --> 00:05:08.007
from the Democratic side

00:05:08.007 --> 00:05:09.108
that actually say

00:05:09.108 --> 00:05:10.310
present these individuals

00:05:10.310 --> 00:05:12.078
to the American public without delay.

00:05:12.078 --> 00:05:12.445
We want

00:05:12.445 --> 00:05:13.613
we want to hear from them

00:05:13.613 --> 00:05:15.948
because they do not have the goods.

00:05:15.948 --> 00:05:17.483
They are not whistleblowers.

00:05:17.483 --> 00:05:18.851
They do not have any firsthand

00:05:18.851 --> 00:05:21.154
information about fraud, waste and abuse,

00:05:21.187 --> 00:05:22.622
the technical terms

00:05:22.622 --> 00:05:23.489
for being a whistleblower.

00:05:23.489 --> 00:05:25.291
So it doesn't seem like he has it,

00:05:25.291 --> 00:05:26.793
at least
with the three people

00:05:26.793 --> 00:05:28.261
that have actually gone

00:05:28.261 --> 00:05:29.796
before the subcommittee. Right.

00:05:29.796 --> 00:05:31.230
I mean, just again, to make the point is

00:05:31.230 --> 00:05:32.165
everybody should be aware

00:05:32.165 --> 00:05:33.066
if Jim Jordan had it,

00:05:33.066 --> 00:05:34.233
he would be blasting it.

00:05:34.233 --> 00:05:35.134
He wouldn't be upset

00:05:35.134 --> 00:05:36.102
that somebody was leaking it.

00:05:36.102 --> 00:05:37.870
So just it's just a very basic

00:05:37.870 --> 00:05:39.272
kind of gut check here now.

00:05:39.272 --> 00:05:39.906
Steve Friend,

00:05:39.906 --> 00:05:41.307
one of the whistleblowers

00:05:41.307 --> 00:05:42.275
that we saw, the sound bite from him

00:05:42.275 --> 00:05:44.444
on Fox News at Zero Share.

00:05:44.444 --> 00:05:46.579
He's a former FBI agent in Florida.

00:05:46.579 --> 00:05:47.680
He was suspended last year

00:05:47.680 --> 00:05:49.816
for objecting to that SWAT raid

00:05:49.816 --> 00:05:50.550
of a suspect

00:05:50.550 --> 00:05:51.651
who had been at January six

00:05:51.651 --> 00:05:54.253
and had an AR 15 style rifle.

00:05:54.554 --> 00:05:57.357
So what do you make of that situation?

00:05:58.124 --> 00:05:58.825
So it's

00:05:59.959 --> 00:06:00.960
also like not

00:06:00.960 --> 00:06:02.595
the poster child one once

00:06:02.595 --> 00:06:03.196
if you're thinking

00:06:03.196 --> 00:06:04.230
that these people are whistleblowers.

00:06:04.230 --> 00:06:05.531
So the idea from Jim Jordan is

00:06:05.531 --> 00:06:07.367
this is a conscientious objector,

00:06:07.367 --> 00:06:08.201
but now we find out

00:06:08.201 --> 00:06:09.202
what did he object to?

00:06:09.202 --> 00:06:12.672
He resisted and refused to assist the FBI

00:06:12.672 --> 00:06:15.541
in its SWAT arrest of this individual

00:06:15.541 --> 00:06:17.844
who is an alleged three percenter

00:06:17.844 --> 00:06:18.678
militia member.

00:06:18.678 --> 00:06:19.212
And in fact,

00:06:19.212 --> 00:06:20.980
they were called the B squad,

00:06:20.980 --> 00:06:22.815
and they're featured in the final report

00:06:22.815 --> 00:06:24.183
by the January six committee

00:06:24.183 --> 00:06:26.252
because they engage in the assault

00:06:26.252 --> 00:06:28.488
on the Capitol and in fact, under attack,

00:06:28.488 --> 00:06:29.422
soon to be armed,

00:06:29.422 --> 00:06:31.023
somebody known to be armed and dangerous.

00:06:31.023 --> 00:06:31.424
And in fact,

00:06:31.424 --> 00:06:33.359
under Testa, in his testimony, Friend

00:06:33.359 --> 00:06:34.827
then admits

00:06:34.827 --> 00:06:35.461
that he was known

00:06:35.461 --> 00:06:36.429
to be armed and dangerous

00:06:36.429 --> 00:06:37.663
and then that would qualify

00:06:37.663 --> 00:06:38.831
for a SWAT operation.

00:06:38.831 --> 00:06:40.166
So it just all falls apart.

00:06:40.166 --> 00:06:41.534
He admits that qualifies,

00:06:41.534 --> 00:06:42.735
but he didn't do it and wants

00:06:42.735 --> 00:06:44.070
conscientious objector status

00:06:44.070 --> 00:06:45.872
doesn't add up. Exactly.

00:06:45.872 --> 00:06:46.272
All right, Ryan

00:06:46.272 --> 00:06:47.407
Goodman, thank you very much.

